Package: mica-lifecycle
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mos build <mos@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: static native lifecycle executables for the signed kernel image
 mica-init and mica-shutdown, built static for this architecture, under
 /usr/lib/mica/lifecycle/. Not for installation into a root: the assembly's
 kernel component reads them out of this archive and packs them into the
 initramfs and the exit ramdisk of the signed kernel, where they are part
 of the authenticated kernel identity.
